{
  "an4.5:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.5 ",
  "an4.5:0.2": "1. Bhaṇḍagāmavagga ",
  "an4.5:0.3": "Anusotasutta ",
  "an4.5:1.1": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "an4.5:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.5:1.3": "Anusotagāmī puggalo, paṭisotagāmī puggalo, ṭhitatto puggalo, tiṇṇo pāraṅgato thale tiṭṭhati brāhmaṇo. ",
  "an4.5:1.4": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, anusotagāmī puggalo? ",
  "an4.5:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo kāme ca paṭisevati, pāpañca kammaṁ karoti. ",
  "an4.5:1.6": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, anusotagāmī puggalo. ",
  "an4.5:2.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, paṭisotagāmī puggalo? ",
  "an4.5:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo kāme ca nappaṭisevati, pāpañca kammaṁ na karoti, sahāpi dukkhena sahāpi domanassena assumukhopi rudamāno paripuṇṇaṁ parisuddhaṁ brahmacariyaṁ carati. ",
  "an4.5:2.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, paṭisotagāmī puggalo. ",
  "an4.5:3.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, ṭhitatto puggalo? ",
  "an4.5:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo pañcannaṁ orambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ parikkhayā opapātiko hoti, tattha parinibbāyī, anāvattidhammo tasmā lokā. ",
  "an4.5:3.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, ṭhitatto puggalo. ",
  "an4.5:4.1": "Katamo ca, bhikkhave, puggalo tiṇṇo pāraṅgato thale tiṭṭhati brāhmaṇo? ",
  "an4.5:4.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo āsavānaṁ khayā anāsavaṁ cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ diṭṭheva dhamme sayaṁ